Aṅgada comforts weary monkeys urging renewed search --- Aṅgada notes searched forests caves find neither Sītā nor stealer --- Aṅgada warns much time gone stern Sugrīva threatens --- Aṅgada preaches perseverance skill dauntless mind bring success --- Gandhamādana thirst-hoarse seconds Aṅgada wholesome counsel --- Monkeys rise roaming southern Vindhya expanses again --- Monkeys climb silver mountain searching Lōdhra Saptaparṇa woods --- Climbers miss Vaidehī descend resting then resume southward
